[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 32357.868, "timestamp": "08:59:17", "text": "。  我得到它。是的。他們……他們……呃……日本人不知道為什麼特別喜歡蛋黃醬。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32361.35, "timestamp": "08:59:21", "text": "打字不快，也不擅長同時給兩個人發訊息。別擔心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32367.43, "timestamp": "08:59:27", "text": "。別操心。別擔心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32369.91, "timestamp": "08:59:29", "text": "呃，慢慢來。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32373.75, "timestamp": "08:59:33", "text": "你會下地獄的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32376.388, "timestamp": "08:59:36", "text": "。非常感謝。不錯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32379.11, "timestamp": "08:59:39", "text": "你搞定了。走吧。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32392.708, "timestamp": "08:59:52", "text": "不是跟你說話，Ugabooga。我說的是敵人。你管得著嗎？是啊。還有，兒子，呃，你可以，呃，呃，回覆任何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32394.628, "timestamp": "08:59:54", "text": "聊天。"}]